-`⟨R, v⟩`, the value `(σ • c) ⟨R, v⟩ = c ⟨R, σ⁻¹ ∘ v⟩` reads `c` at a query whose tuple depends on
-`σ` through the finitely many *continuous* evaluations `σ⁻¹ (v i)`. On the clopen neighborhood where
